{"assets":["/statement-assets/994e4c00e3255b29745b2e8128dee9477cca8707a12079b548a2f2290f5dc7f1.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"855","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Nagini"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Nagini, being a horcrux You-know-who created with the murder of Bertha Jorkins, has accumulated its army of snakes and is launching an attack on Hogwarts school. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hogwarts' entrance can be imagined as a straight line (x-axis) from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"105"},{"kind":"text","text":". Nagini is launching various snakes at the Hogwarts entrance. Each snake lands parallel to the entrance, covering a segment at a distance "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = l"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = r"},{"kind":"text","text":". Formally, each snake can be imagined as being a line segment between points "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(l, k)"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(r, k)"},{"kind":"text","text":". Note that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" can be both positive and negative, but not "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let, at some "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":"-coordinate "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = i"},{"kind":"text","text":", there be snakes at point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i, y1)"},{"kind":"text","text":" and point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i, y2)"},{"kind":"text","text":", such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y1 > 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y2 < 0"},{"kind":"text","text":". Then, if for any point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i, y3)"},{"kind":"text","text":" containing a snake such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y3 > 0"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y1 ≤ y3"},{"kind":"text","text":" holds and for any point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i, y4)"},{"kind":"text","text":" containing a snake such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y4 < 0"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|y2| ≤ |y4|"},{"kind":"text","text":" holds, then the danger value at coordinate "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = i"},{"kind":"text","text":" is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y1 + |y2|"},{"kind":"text","text":". If no such "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y2"},{"kind":"text","text":" exist, danger value is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Harry wants to calculate the danger value of various segments of the Hogwarts entrance. Danger value for a segment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[l, r)"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the entrance can be calculated by taking the sum of danger values for each integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":"-coordinate present in the segment."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Formally, you have to implement two types of queries:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1 l r k"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":": a snake is added parallel to entrance from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = l"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = r"},{"kind":"text","text":" at y-coordinate "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y = k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" inclusive, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" exclusive). "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2 l r"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":": you have to calculate the danger value of segment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" inclusive, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" exclusive). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"First line of input contains a single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ q ≤ 5·104"},{"kind":"text","text":") denoting the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines each describe a query. Each query description first contains the query type "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"typei"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ typei ≤ 2"},{"kind":"text","text":"). This is followed by further description of the query. In case of the type being "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":", it is followed by integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"li, ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/994e4c00e3255b29745b2e8128dee9477cca8707a12079b548a2f2290f5dc7f1.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" - 109 ≤ ki ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k ≠ 0"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Otherwise, it just contains two integers, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"li"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ li < ri ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output the answer for each query of type 2 in a separate line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n1 1 10 10\n1 2 4 -7\n2 1 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"34\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7\n1 2 3 5\n1 1 10 10\n1 4 5 -5\n2 4 8\n1 1 10 -10\n2 4 8\n2 1 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"15\n75\n170\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample case, the danger value for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":"-coordinates "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" as there is no "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y2"},{"kind":"text","text":" satisfying the above condition for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Danger values for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":"-coordinates "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10 + | - 7| = 17"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Danger values for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":"-coordinates "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"4"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"9"},{"kind":"text","text":" is again "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" as there is no "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y2"},{"kind":"text","text":" satisfying the above condition for these coordinates."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Thus, total danger value is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"17 + 17 = 34"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"855F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/855/problem/F"}